node_modules/
web/dist/
data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.tsv.gz
*.log
.DS_Store
.env
.env.local

# Compiled spellfix1. The SOURCE is vendored (vendor/sqlite-spellfix/spellfix.c) and
# tracked; the binary is per-platform and built by the Dockerfile, or by
# `bun run spellfix:build` for macOS dev. Committing one would be committing the wrong
# architecture for somebody.
*.so
*.dylib

# Local tooling -- never committed.
.claude/

# The agent brief, both halves. NOT tracked, and this is deliberate rather than an
# oversight: it is a working document about how this codebase is built and who decided
# what, which is a different thing from the code itself. It stays on the machines that
# need it. A negation (`!CLAUDE.md`) used to force it INTO the repo; that is gone.
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md

# Deployment-specific, never committed: real hostnames, addresses and reverse-proxy
# labels live here rather than in the tracked compose file.
docker-compose.override.yml

# The icon candidates that lost -- four rounds of exploration kept locally as a record
# of what was already tried and why it died. Useful to whoever proposes a redesign,
# uninteresting to anyone else, and 2.3 MB of PNGs nothing in the app ever loads.
# `assets/brand/*.svg` is still tracked and is the single owner of the shipped mark.
assets/brand/explorations/

# The Kometa logo set, fetched at build time by `bun run logos:import` rather than
# tracked: 826 PNGs that belong to their trademark holders, not to this repo.
web/public/logos/

# Local screenshots from browser checks.
preview/
.rclaude/
